    → Searches LinkedIn for CFO history (tool call)
    → Cross-references with industry contacts database
    → Finds pattern with another company 2 years ago
    → Decides this angle is the real story
    → Writes investigative piece around findings

  Why agent here?
  - Story direction unknown at the start
  - Each discovery changed the next step
  - Required judgment on what matters
  - Could not be scripted in advance

  ---
  Scenario 3: E-Commerce Order Processing

  As a Workflow

  Processing 5,000 orders per day.

  Order placed
        │
        ▼
  Step 1: Validate payment
        │
        ▼
  Step 2: Check inventory
        │
      ┌─┴─┐
     Yes   No
      │     │
      │     ▼
      │   Notify customer
